README

Here you can add your own configs without getting affected by version updates or other official changes.

For example, copy one of the config from .fvwm/Extension or make your own, and add with Read+link in .fvwm/userEXT.sys.

Replace $[EXT_DIR] with $[USER_DIR], example:

Read $[EXT_DIR]/Menu.conf
to
Read $[USER_DIR]/Menu.conf
